# Use with VS Code REST Client or Visual Studio (.http). Start the API first: dotnet run --project src/AiOralExam.Api
@host = http://localhost:5080

### Sign in as a student who has not taken the exam yet -> copy accessToken into @token
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "han.hg@aives.edu.vn", "password": "Password@123" }

###
@token = paste-access-token-here

### My exam sessions
GET {{host}}/api/interview/my-sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start an attempt (SWD392 session, currently open)
POST {{host}}/api/interview-attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "examSessionId": "33333333-0000-0000-0000-000000000001" }

### Submit an answer (replace ATTEMPT_ID)
POST {{host}}/api/interview-attempts/ATTEMPT_ID/responses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "answerText": "A modular monolith is deployed as one unit but split into business modules; each module owns its tables and talks to the others only through interfaces." }

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health
